Render the stream
  Read the latest frame and version from the selected stream.
  Update the displayed image when the frame or its contents change.
  Clear the image if the stream has no frame.
  Fit the image to the view or apply the current head tracking transform.
  Apply horizontal mirroring when enabled.

Draw
  In single-image mode, draw the transformed image once.
  In Cardboard mode, draw the same transformed image in each half.
  Clip each eye to its own half of the view.
